# Agent routing (system wrapper)

**Repo entry:** [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md). **Do not** treat [docs/roadmap.md](../../docs/roadmap.md) as the queue.

## User mode

| Mode | Work source | Code / cards |
| ---- | ----------- | ------------ |
| **Agent** (default) | **Kanban** `.devtool/features/` — To Do card path, id, or title | Follow [kanban-markdown/SKILL.md](../skills/kanban-markdown/SKILL.md); ignore Backlog |
| **Ask** | User question | Read-only — no card moves, no edits unless user leaves Ask mode |

## Turn lifecycle

```text
START → agent-triage/SKILL.md (classify + tools)
WORK  → card Label Paths OR surgical grep → minimal edit
VERIFY → targeted pytest; pre-commit-pytest.sh before Review/commit
END   → agent-self-evaluation/SKILL.md + handoff block
```

**Implementation / fix / refactor:** edit **≥1** `.cursor/skills/*` and **≥1** `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` before handoff (different learnings — skill = workflow, rule = constraint).

## Kanban card type (read `labels` in frontmatter)

| Label | Rule | Agent plan section |
| ----- | ---- | ------------------ |
| `bug` | [kanban-bug-cards.mdc](kanban-bug-cards.mdc) | **Corrective Action** (not Decisions) |
| `inquiry` | [kanban-inquiry-cards.mdc](kanban-inquiry-cards.mdc) | **Response** only — no code by default |
| *(feature)* | — | **Decisions** |

Resolve **Feature Areas** → **Label Paths** via `docs/feature-areas.yaml` before `in-progress`.

## Load skills (on demand — not all every turn)

| Touching | Read first |
| -------- | ---------- |
| Unfamiliar layout | [repo-map/SKILL.md](../skills/repo-map/SKILL.md) |
| Kanban card | [kanban-markdown/SKILL.md](../skills/kanban-markdown/SKILL.md) |
| UI | [ui-change/SKILL.md](../skills/ui-change/SKILL.md) + matching `ui-*.mdc` |
| Tests / commit | [targeted-testing/SKILL.md](../skills/targeted-testing/SKILL.md) |
| Docs after code | [docs-maintenance/SKILL.md](../skills/docs-maintenance/SKILL.md) |
| Minecraft / versions | [project-context/SKILL.md](../skills/project-context/SKILL.md) |

## Discovery budget

- **Grep** before opening `ui/main_window.py` or other large files
- After **3** full file reads → prefer grep or semantic search
- Ad-hoc one-file fixes → **surgical** (no kanban) unless user assigns a card

## Handoff (last section — every response)

Include `Skills updated:` and `Rules updated:` — both required on implementation turns. See [agent-self-evaluation.mdc](agent-self-evaluation.mdc).
